; &lt;button type="submit" name="submit" value="Save" id="submit-id-submit"\n    class="btn btn-primary"&gt;&lt;i class="fa-regular fa-floppy-disk" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;span&gt;Save&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;button type="button" name="reset" value="Cancel" id="button-id-reset"\n    class="btn btn-secondary" data-cv-cancel-url="/queryset-conditional/service-request/"&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-xmark" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;span&gt;Cancel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt; &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n\n&lt;/form&gt;\n\n\n\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n    \n\n    &lt;div class="mt-4" id="snippet-panels"&gt;\n        &lt;h2 class="h5"&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-code" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; The code behind this page&lt;/h2&gt;\n        \n            &lt;p class="text-body-secondary"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Look at:&lt;/strong&gt; models.py owns the service categories and requests; conditions.py declares the shared category mapping. The editor module shown below applies it to the page&amp;#x27;s form and layout.&lt;/p&gt;\n        \n        &lt;div class="accordion" id="snippetAccordion"&gt;\n            \n                &lt;div class="accordion-item"&gt;\n                    &lt;h3 class="h2 accordion-header"&gt;\n                        &lt;button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"\n                                data-bs-target="#snippet-queryset_conditional-models-py" aria-controls="snippet-queryset_conditional-models-py"&gt;\n                            queryset_conditional/models.py\n                        &lt;/button&gt;\n                    &lt;/h3&gt;\n                    &lt;div id="snippet-queryset_conditional-models-py" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#snippetAccordion"&gt;\n                        &lt;div class="accordion-body overflow-auto"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight" style="background: #f0f0f0"&gt;&lt;pre style="line-height: 125%;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #0E84B5; font-weight: bold"&gt;django.db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; models\n&lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #0E84B5; font-weight: bold"&gt;django.utils.translation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; gettext_lazy &lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; _\n\n\n&lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #0E84B5; font-weight: bold"&gt;ServiceCategory&lt;/span&gt;(models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;Model):\n    code &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;CharField(_(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"code"&lt;/span&gt;), max_length&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #40A070"&gt;40&lt;/span&gt;, unique&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;)\n\n    &lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #0E84B5; font-weight: bold"&gt;Meta&lt;/span&gt;:\n        ordering &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; [&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"code"&lt;/span&gt;]\n        verbose_name &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; _(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"service category"&lt;/span&gt;)\n        verbose_name_plural &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; _(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"service categories"&lt;/span&gt;)\n\n    &lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #06287E"&gt;__str__&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color: #007020"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;):\n        &lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color: #007020"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;code\n\n\n&lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #0E84B5; font-weight: bold"&gt;Service&lt;/span&gt;(models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;Model):\n    name &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;CharField(_(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"name"&lt;/span&gt;), max_length&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #40A070"&gt;100&lt;/span&gt;)\n    category &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;ForeignKey(ServiceCategory, on_delete&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;PROTECT, verbose_name&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;_(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"category"&lt;/span&gt;))\n\n    &lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #0E84B5; font-weight: bold"&gt;Meta&lt;/span&gt;:\n        ordering &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; [&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"name"&lt;/span&gt;]\n\n    &lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #06287E"&gt;__str__&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color: #007020"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;):\n        &lt;span style="color: #60A0B0; font-style: italic"&gt;# Native option labels use an already-loaded field, never a category query.&lt;/span&gt;\n        &lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color: #007020"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;name\n\n\n&lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #0E84B5; font-weight: bold"&gt;RequestBatch&lt;/span&gt;(models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;Model):\n    title &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;CharField(_(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"title"&lt;/span&gt;), max_length&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #40A070"&gt;100&lt;/span&gt;)\n\n    &lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #0E84B5; font-weight: bold"&gt;Meta&lt;/span&gt;:\n        ordering &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; [&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"title"&lt;/span&gt;]\n        verbose_name &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; _(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"request batch"&lt;/span&gt;)\n        verbose_name_plural &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; _(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"request batches"&lt;/span&gt;)\n\n    &lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #06287E"&gt;__str__&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color: #007020"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;):\n        &lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color: #007020"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;title\n\n\n&lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #0E84B5; font-weight: bold"&gt;ServiceRequest&lt;/span&gt;(models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;Model):\n    batch &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;ForeignKey(\n        RequestBatch, on_delete&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;CASCADE, related_name&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"requests"&lt;/span&gt;, blank&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;, null&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;, verbose_name&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;_(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"batch"&lt;/span&gt;)\n    )\n    service &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;ForeignKey(Service, on_delete&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;PROTECT, verbose_name&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;_(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"service"&lt;/span&gt;))\n    visit_address &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;CharField(_(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"visit address"&lt;/span&gt;), max_length&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #40A070"&gt;200&lt;/span&gt;, blank&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;)\n    meeting_url &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; models&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;URLField(_(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"meeting URL"&lt;/span&gt;), blank&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;)\n\n    &lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #0E84B5; font-weight: bold"&gt;Meta&lt;/span&gt;:\n        ordering &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; [&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"pk"&lt;/span&gt;]\n        verbose_name &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; _(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"service request"&lt;/span&gt;)\n        verbose_name_plural &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; _(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"service requests"&lt;/span&gt;)\n\n    &lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #BBB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #06287E"&gt;__str__&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color: #007020"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;):\n        &lt;span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; _(&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"Service request &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #70A0D0; font-style: italic"&gt;%(pk)s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;%&lt;/span&gt; {&lt;span style="color: #4070A0"&gt;"pk"&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color: #007020"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #666"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;pk}\n&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n                    &lt;/div&gt;\n                &lt;/div&gt;\n            \n        &lt;/div&gt;\n        \n            &lt;h2 class="h5 mt-3"&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-book" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; References to documentation&lt;/h2&gt;\n            &lt;ul&gt;\n                \n                    &lt;li&gt;\n                        &lt;a href="https://django-crud-views.readthedocs.io/en/stable/reference/conditional/#kind-1-conditional-field-group-in-a-form" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Conditional field-groups\n                            &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square small" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span class="visually-hidden"&gt;(opens in a new tab)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\n                    &lt;/li&gt;\n                \n            &lt;/ul&gt;\n        \n    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n\n\n\n\n&lt;/main&gt;\n\n\n    \n&lt;footer class="container border-top mt-5 py-3 text-muted small" id="site-footer"&gt;\n    &lt;span&gt;django-crud-views 0.30.0&lt;/span&gt;\n    &amp;middot;\n    &lt;a href="https://django-crud-views.readthedocs.io/" class="link-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;\n        &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-book" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Docs&lt;/a&gt;\n    &amp;middot;\n    &lt;a href="https://github.com/jacob-consulting/django-crud-views" class="link-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;\n        &lt;i class="fa-brands fa-github" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; GitHub&lt;/a&gt;\n    &amp;middot;\n    &lt;a href="https://django-crud-views-demo.onrender.com/" class="link-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;\n        &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-globe" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Live demo&lt;/a&gt;\n&lt;/footer&gt;\n\n\n\n&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;\n'</failure></testcase></testsuite></testsuites>